id: bishop-caste
name: Bishop
order: 4
optionOf: caste-combat
optionEffect: 3
# Pieces of the Hive's Bishop chosen: this one.
follows: bishop
description: >
  Reduce the Ki Point Cost of all Attacking Maneuvers and Unique Abilities by 2(T).
text: >
  Bishop [Passive]: Reduce the Ki Point Cost of all Attacking Maneuvers and Unique Abilities by 2(T).

---

